{"items":[{"id":"c1lnjgv481un1e1","content":"分院帽大概会给我分在拉文克劳吧  什么都学点 什么又都菜  又菜又爱学 ","type":"murmur","typeLabel":"murmur","title":"","author":"","date":"2025.04.28 22:35","tags":[],"pinned":false,"repost":null,"repost_count":0,"images":[],"videos":[],"audios":[],"link_image":"","link_title":"","link_description":"","url":""},{"id":"3jh72yaeyrjvkkd","content":"「我才不要统治这片海域  最自由的人便是海贼王」","type":"murmur","typeLabel":"murmur","title":"","author":"","date":"2022.04.28 23:23","tags":["海贼王"],"pinned":true,"repost":null,"repost_count":0,"images":[],"videos":[],"audios":[],"link_image":"","link_title":"","link_description":"","url":""},{"id":"hhhr1yqvqg291xl","content":"我们上学的时候都听过那句 戏谑的 「差学校就只会抓纪律」  在经济下行的周期之下 政客们也会这么做来分散主要矛盾   比如 微博显示来源地 \r\n\r\n其实这件事都13年就已经开始了  未来只会越来越感受到这种政策的高压和无限的拘束","type":"murmur","typeLabel":"murmur","title":"","author":"","date":"2022.04.28 23:22","tags":[],"pinned":false,"repost":null,"repost_count":0,"images":[],"videos":[],"audios":[],"link_image":"","link_title":"","link_description":"","url":""},{"id":"z6hij3hwmdaic5i","content":"中文系的女生比例占比很大 / 很容易對那種有才華且浪漫的老師產生愛慕情結/文學當然不是一種巧言令色  但是 食色性也(Food and sex are human nature.)/ 這就導致了千千萬萬个房思琪  比如「千與千尋」 中描述的種種美好善良勇敢 /以及宮崎駿令人舒適的畫風/你很難想像「宮崎駿的刺」","type":"thought","typeLabel":"thought","title":"","author":"","date":"2020.04.28 04:12","tags":[],"pinned":false,"repost":null,"repost_count":0,"images":[],"videos":[],"audios":[],"link_image":"","link_title":"","link_description":"","url":""}]}
